==============================================================================
 CO3.1  4 KB PAGES vs 2 MB HUGEPAGES for the 128 MB working set
==============================================================================
   4 KB pages      :  32,768 PTEs cover 128 MB, page tables =   128.00 KB, TLB entries needed = 32,768
   2 MB hugepages  :      64 PTEs cover 128 MB, page tables =     0.25 KB, TLB entries needed = 64
   -> hugepages cut TLB pressure 512x for the database tier, at the cost
      of coarser reclaim granularity; recommended for the DB VMs only.

